
SentBy
------

A Small utility and replacement for the internal "Sent by" signature on
file descriptions.

Remove the USE_SENTBY from your conf.cfg setup from the conference where
you wish to use this utility.



INSTALL:

Copy the directory "LBBS_SentBy" and its contents, into your DOORS
 directory.


Create a setupfile in {BBSMAINPATH}COMMANDS/SYSCMD called 'FCHECK.1'

Cut out below lines and insert into the FCHECK.1 file.
>---------------------------------------
NAME		LogicBBS SentBy
CONFERENCE	PUBLIC				;Conference to use it in
ACCESSLEVEL	5
LOCATION	DOORS:LBBS_Sentby/SentBy	;Path and filename of door
 PASSWORD
 RETURNSTATUS
PRIORITY	1
STACK		4096
RETURNOUTPUT
 QUICKMODE
TYPE		XIM
---------------------------------------<



Users must be able to enter their sent by line from the menu prompt.
So you must configure the same to tool for use, from the menu prompt.

Create a setupfile in {BBSMAINPATH}COMMANDS/BBSCMD called 'SENT'


Cut out below lines and insert into the SENT file.
>-------------------------------------------------
NAME		SentBy
ACCESSLEVEL	5
LOCATION	DOORS:LBBS_Sentby/SentBy
 PASSWORD
 RETURNSTATUS
PRIORITY	1
STACK		4096
RETURNOUTPUT
 QUICKMODE
TYPE		XIM
-------------------------------------------------<



From the menu prompt users can type SENT, and enter their sentby line.

